        "toolDescription": "Search the Arise Real Estate property database for project information. Use this tool for ANY question about KSL Riverhaus, Avenia, Macrolink Medini, Kews Green, or Isola Coast Phase 2. Returns full project details including developer, price, units, facilities, sales package, bank financing, and any document/image links (price list, floor plan, brochure, photos).",
        "pineconeIndex": {
